Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.06,0:03:47.81,对白 日语,,0,0,0,,萌智子?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.06,0:03:47.81,对白 中文,,0,0,0,,萌智子?
Dialogue: 2,0:03:46.75,0:03:48.42,下集标题,,0,0,0,,{\fs-1\c&H40C81C&\blur1\frz25.72\move(1045.1,948.9,1046.0,947.6)\fscx99.9\fscy99.9}呼入中…
